# Credentials. This repo is PUBLIC (MIT), and npm auth tokens live in .npmrc
# files — a token pushed here is compromised within minutes of landing.
# Ignored even though none is committed today, because the safe way to scope a
# publish token to this project is a local .npmrc, and that is exactly the file
# that must never be pushed. Prefer NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG pointing OUTSIDE the
# repo, or publishing from CI with a repo secret.
.npmrc
.npmrc.*
